  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported SetInputUnitForLength, SetInputUnitForForce, both SetShortJobInfo overloads and UpdateStructure with matching complete XML IntelliSense. Validated unit codes, retained the individual length setter feet alias and snapshotted short job fields before one native request. Preserved caller-thread, binding, lifetime and reentrancy guards with explicit cache refresh and native void-completion semantics. Forty Root operations are implemented; see the model edits guide for consumer contracts and native qualification limits.",
